  <div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">About</span><h1>Hi, I'm Javad.</h1><p>A Senior Data Scientist working on vehicle valuation and production machine learning at CARFAX Canada.</p></div>
  <section class="split-section"><h2>A little background</h2><div class="prose"><p>I'm based in Greater Vancouver and am responsible for CARFAX Canada’s vehicle valuation model. My work covers price prediction using market data and vehicle history, model evaluation, and deployment through production APIs. I also lead LLM work on information extraction and summarization.</p><p>My background spans data engineering and applied machine learning, with a master's degree in Computer Science from Memorial University of Newfoundland. Before CARFAX Canada, I coached data science learners at Concordia University Boot Camp and worked on physical activity analysis at BEAP Lab.</p><p>This site brings together my professional background, earlier research, open-source work, and technical writing.</p><a href="/work/" class="text-link">Explore my experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
